        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And frigman se ðe cwicne on þære mundbyrde geyfelige, sylle XXX scillinga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And a freeman who injures a living person under protection is to give thirty shillings.</ab>
